        "properties": {
            "description": "A microstrip on 100 um of alumina whose width w the Optimization sets for a 50 Ohm line, quasi-static. Hammerstad and Jensen's closed form, for a strip of no thickness, gives 97.2 um; this model's mesh, 6 cells across the strip, about 102 um, and finer meshes approach 99.5 um (100.0 at 16 cells across, 99.7 at 24). Run it from RF 2.5D > Run Optimization; Apply Optimum writes w in."
        },
